{"text": "Now the old banker remembered all this and thought, Tomorrow at twelve oclock he will be free. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If I pay him two million, I will be completely ruined. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Fifteen years before, he had more money than he could count, but now he was afraid to ask himself which he had more of, money or debts. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Reckless gambling on the stock market had slowly destroyed his fortune. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The only way to save myself from shame is for that man to die, he whispered. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At three oclock in the morning, he took the key to the lodge and went quietly into the garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was dark and cold, and the watchman was asleep somewhere because of the bad weather. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Through the window, he saw the prisoner sitting at the table, not moving at all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was only skin and bones, with long hair like a womans and a wild, shaggy beard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His head was resting on his hands, and in front of him lay a sheet of paper covered with small writing.", "alignment": {"characters": ["N", "o", "w", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "b", "a", "n", "k", "e", "r", " ", "r", "e", "m", "e", "m", "b", "e", "r", "e", "d", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "g", "h", "t", ",", " ", "T", "o", "m", "o", "r", "r", "o", "w", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "w", "e", "l", "v", "e", " ", "o", "c", "l", "o", "c", "k", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "b", "e", " ", "f", "r", "e", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "f", " ", "I", " ", "p", "a", "y", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "m", "i", "l", "l", "i", "o", "n", ",", " ", "I", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "b", "e", " ", "c", "o", "m", "p", "l", "e", "t", "e", "l", "y", " ", "r", "u", "i", "n", "e", "d", ".", 